{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e5e7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b368-b8fb-7503-b19c-2c040425ca00"},"sequence":4430,"recorded_at":1780531400008855,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"9c78dd5e-2606-42c8-9e04-207bbea54fed","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"9c78dd5e-2606-42c8-9e04-207bbea54fed","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"9c78dd5e-2606-42c8-9e04-207bbea54fed"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Ready for review — handed off to review.\n\nTASK-260830-32ypr2 is `to-review` (checklist 14/14, 3 outcomes attached). The candidate is the uncommitted Story worktree on refreshed branch tip `3005d78` over trunk `c3aae73`.\n\nWhat this run did:\n\n- **Refresh first.** The branch tip (`47294bb` on `a12d1bd`) predated trunk `c3aae73`, so `refresh-candidate` ran before anything else: `refresh_advanced` with a checkpoint-bound LOGBOOK replay (trunk's 4qojoz entry kept newest-first). Restored trunk bytes for every carried stale revert (`.task-board`, `meshneg`, `rpcwire` tests, `matjournal` test, `task-board.config.json` byte-identical, 30 commands).\n- **Story-close as a merge, never a replace.** HEAD registry + 4 appended cases + transplanted 7.8/10.2 full bindings (trunk's 5 cases + 3 upgraded bindings kept). Pin re-derived from the gate: `69d156d9…2235052a`. `tracecheck` green at cases=144, full=4, partial=8, sliver=5, unevidenced=47, clauses 63/569, with `--section 7.8` and `--section 10.2` admitted. README, pin tests (incl. extended admits lists and `twelve`/`forty-seven` words), and LOGBOOK rebuilt on new trunk bytes.\n- **Verified the inherited package firsthand, then strengthened it.** Every proof runs real `clonesnap.Capture` then `Normalize`; no test touches helpers; literal-token assertions; landed reuse confirmed (`len` bytes vs the landed gate, character measures, digit-only uint53). Added 5 narrowing rows (49 killed + control survived, battery twice, exit 0, per-plant raw logs) so each headline test has a directly-reddening plant, plus a verified cross-kill probe and a new main-null-parent assertion.\n- **Full validation reran on the final tree:** all 30 commands exit 0 (race gate in 7 bounded groups, 41/41 packages, no DATA RACE; cloneproject 88.9% coverage). AC ratio **24 of 24 rows driven**, mapped in the attached conformance matrix with call sites, narrowings, bounds, and 13.14.2–13.14.5 non-ownership.","reason":null}}
